# Read path — customer request to bytes

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer / Agent
  participant L4 as Layer 4 API
  participant IDX as Postgres atoms index
  participant LINK as atom_links
  participant BODY as atom body JSONB
  participant PROV as Provenance chain

  C->>L4: GET parcel dossier
  L4->>IDX: resolve parcel-node by entity_id
  IDX->>BODY: fetch fact rows by parcelNodeId or entity_type
  Note over LINK: applies-to traversal STARVED - body path used
  L4->>LINK: optional traverse cites/contains
  BODY->>PROV: sourceAdapter sourceUrl fetchedAt
  L4->>C: response with provenance + confidence
```

Out of scope for this diagram: IPFS body fetch (production serves JSONB from Postgres).
